ing else to us! Are you a community manager or event organiser burning all of your time to manage your community and events. Fed up of paying hefty fees to platforms to just keep it running?"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.ico?ebbeb754ef43c073" type="image/x-icon" sizes="16x16"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="bg-gray-50"><!--$--><div class="bg-white"><header class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-50"><nav class="bg-transparent"><div class="hidden sm:block bg-white border-b-2 border-gray-300 px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex h-16 justify-between"><div class="flex"><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><a href="/"><div class="relative bg-white rounded-md px-3 h-18 w-18 sm:mt-0 sm:px-0 sm:h-9 sm:w-9 "><img alt="Odd Circles Logo" loading="lazy" width="0" height="0" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-9 h-9 top-0 left-0 object-cover rounded-2xl" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/images/oddcircles.gif"/></div></a></div><div class="hidden sm:-my-px sm:ml-6 sm:flex sm:space-x-8"></div></div><div class="hidden sm:ml-6 sm:flex sm:items-center"><div class="flex flex-row gap-3"><a class="block border-2 p-2 rounded-md cursor-pointer" href="/auth/signin">Sign In</a><a class="ml-2 block border-2 p-2 rounded-md cursor-pointer" href="/auth/signup">Sign Up</a></div></div></div></div><div class="block sm:hidden"><div class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 bg-white py-3 z-40 border-b border-gray-200"><div class="flex items-center justify-between h-18 px-4"><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/"><div class="relative bg-white rounded-md px-3 h-18 w-18 sm:mt-0 sm:px-0 sm:h-9 sm:w-9 "><img alt="Odd Circles Logo" loading="lazy" width="0" height="0" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-9 h-9 top-0 left-0 object-cover rounded-2xl" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/images/oddcircles.gif"/></div></a><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-2 rounded-md text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100" aria-expanded="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"></path></svg></button></div><div class="
            absolute top-14 left-0 right-0 bg-white border-b border-gray-200
            transform transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out
            opacity-0 -translate-y-2 pointer-events-none
          "><nav class="px-4 py-2 space-y-1"></nav><div class="px-4 py-4 border-t border-gray-200 bg-gray-50"><div class="flex flex-row gap-3"><a class="block border-2 p-2 rounded-md cursor-pointer" href="/auth/signin">Sign In</a><a class="ml-2 block border-2 p-2 rounded-md cursor-pointer" href="/auth/signup">Sign Up</a></div></div></div></div><div class="h-14"></div></div></nav></header><main class="bg-white sm:pt-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl"><div class="clear-both my-24 sm:my-0"><div class="bg-yellow-100 rounded-md p-2 mb-3">🎉 Get Ready! 🚀 Our<a class="bg-black px-1 mx-2 text-white" target="_blank" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/odd-circles/id6523432596?uo=4&amp;at=11l6hc&amp;ct=oddcircles">iOS</a>and<a class="bg-blue-600 px-1 mx-2 text-white" target="_blank" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.oddcircles.android">Android</a>apps are here now 📲✨.<a class="bg-black px-1 mx-2 text-white" target="_blank" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/odd-circles/id6523432596?uo=4&amp;at=11l6hc&amp;ct=oddcircles">Download iOS App Here</a><a class="bg-blue-600 px-1 mx-2 text-white" target="_blank" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.oddcircles.android">Download Android App Here</a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-12"><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-7 h-full align-text-middle"><div class="inline-block align-middle px-6 sm:mt-0"><h1 class="mt-3 sm:my-10 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-6xl">The Place Where Communities Ignite Change!</h1><div class="mt-12 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">Imagine having all the tools you need to build, nurture, and grow your community—effortlessly. From bringing people together to sharing knowledge, hosting events, and creating meaningful connections, it&#x27;s all here. One platform, endless possibilities to make your vision thrive.</div><div class="text-xs text-gray-600">Replace your entire tech stack — from Meetup to Mailchimp — with one powerful platform. Community building, event hosting, email, courses, lead magnets, digital products, monetisation tools and much more, all in one place.</div><div class="flex flex-row gap-2"><a class="mt-12 block bg-violet-500 text-white px-6 py-3 text-center font-bold shadow-md rounded-md w-full" href="/groups/add">Launch Your Community</a><a target="_blank" class="mt-12 block bg-blue-400 text-gray-900 px-6 py-3 text-center font-bold shadow-md rounded-md w-full" href="https://cal.com/odd-circles/odd-circles-ash">Book a meeting with our experts</a></div></div></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-5"><div class="relative bg-white rounded-md h-full mt-12 sm:mt-0 px-3 sm:px-0"><img alt="Odd Circles Happy Customers" loading="lazy" width="0" height="0" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full top-0 left-0 object-cover rounded-2xl" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/images/odd-circles-1.png?v=1"/></div></div></div><div class="bg-trasparent mt-36"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 my-6"><div class="md:w-1/3" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a href="/blog/post/the-seth-godin-book-launch"><div class="ml-6 p-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-400 transition-colors duration-300"><img alt="Seth Godin" width="300" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-md" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/images/home/seth-2.jpg"/></div></a></div><div class="md:w-2/3 space-y-4"><div class="
                            text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4
                            
                            
                            
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">Empowering Global Book Launches: The Seth Godin Case Study 📚</div><div class="
                            
                            text-gray-700 mb-3
                            
                            
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">When bestselling author Seth Godin chose to launch 🚀 &#x27;This is Strategy&#x27; through our platform, it demonstrated the power of interconnected communities at odd circles.</div><div class="
                            
                            text-gray-700 mb-3
                            
                            
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">Through our innovative parent-group structure, we orchestrated a synchronised worldwide 🌍 launch that:</div><div class="
                            
                            
                            text-gray-700 pl-4 mb-2
                            
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">🎯 Created a central hub for global coordination</div><div class="
                            
                            
                            text-gray-700 pl-4 mb-2
                            
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">🤝 Enabled localised engagement through sub-groups</div><div class="
                            
                            
                            text-gray-700 pl-4 mb-2
                            
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">⚡️ Facilitated real-time collaboration across time zones</div><div class="
                            
                            
                            text-gray-700 pl-4 mb-2
                            
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">💭 Generated organic discussion and momentum</div><div class="
                            
                            
                            
                            text-gray-700 mt-4 italic
                        " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">By leveraging our nested community structure, this launch transcended traditional book promotion to become a global conversation about strategy, connecting readers and thought leaders across continents.</div><a class="text-gray-700 mt-3 italic" href="/blog/post/the-seth-godin-book-launch">Read More</a></div></div></div><div class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 lg:pb-40"><h1 class="mt-0 sm:mt-10 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-6xl text-center">This is how your group will look like!</h1><div class="mt-16 flow-root sm:mt-24"><div class="-m-2 rounded-xl bg-gray-900/5 p-2 ring-1 ring-inset ring-gray-900/10 lg:-m-4 lg:rounded-2xl lg:p-4"><img src="/assets/images/hero-image.png" alt="Odd Circles" width="2432" height="1442" class="rounded-md shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-gray-900/10"/></div></div></div><div class="relative py-24 sm:py-16 lg:pb-40"><h1 class="mt-0 sm:mt-10 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl text-center">You might have seen this before. Please don&#x27;t hate us!</h1><div class="mt-16 flow-root sm:mt-24"><div class="-m-2 rounded-xl bg-gray-900/5 p-2 ring-1 ring-inset ring-gray-900/10 lg:-m-4 lg:rounded-2xl lg:p-4"><div class="aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LvaFW1THExw" title="YouTube video player" frameBorder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowFullScreen="" class="rounded-md"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="how-it-works" class="relative bg-gray-50 py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-md px-4 text-center sm:max-w-3xl sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:max-w-7xl"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-wider text-blue-600 uppercase">How it works?</h2><div class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Everything you need to Start, Manage and Grow Your Community.</div><div class="mt-5 max-w-prose mx-auto text-xl text-gray-500"> You can start your community with few clicks. And it doesn&#x27;t cost an eye either. </div><div class="mt-12"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="pt-6"><div class="flow-root bg-gray-50 rounded-lg px-6 pb-8"><div class="-mt-6"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-white rounded-md shadow-lg"><div class="text-2xl">Step 1</div></span></div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Create Your Group</h3><div class="mt-5 text-base text-gray-500"> Easily create your group on Odd Circles. Just provide your group name, choose a location and you are all set. </div></div></div></div><div class="pt-6"><div class="flow-root bg-gray-50 rounded-lg px-6 pb-8"><div class="-mt-6"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-white rounded-md shadow-lg"><div class="text-2xl">Step 2</div></span></div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Invite Members</h3><div class="mt-5 text-base text-gray-500"> Share your new groups url on whatsapp, facebook, twitter or even via email. We will promote your group in your city. </div></div></div></div><div class="pt-6"><div class="flow-root bg-gray-50 rounded-lg px-6 pb-8"><div class="-mt-6"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-white rounded-md shadow-lg"><div class="text-2xl">Step 3</div></span></div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Manage Members</h3><div class="mt-5 text-base text-gray-500"> If you spot someone breaking your group rules. You can always ban them or issue a warning. </div></div></div></div><div class="pt-6"><div class="flow-root bg-gray-50 rounded-lg px-6 pb-8"><div class="-mt-6"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-white rounded-md shadow-lg"><div class="text-2xl">Step 4</div></span></div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Host Events</h3><div class="mt-5 text-base text-gray-500"> You can create or copy events easily with few clicks. Host events with our all in one even hosting solution. </div></div></div></div><div class="pt-6"><div class="flow-root bg-gray-50 rounded-lg px-6 pb-8"><div class="-mt-6"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-white rounded-md shadow-lg"><div class="text-2xl">Step 5</div></span></div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Sell Event Tickets</h3><div class="mt-5 text-base text-gray-500"> Sell event tickets without paying any commision. We will only charge a fee to buyers. </div></div></div></div><div class="pt-6"><div class="flow-root bg-gray-50 rounded-lg px-6 pb-8"><div class="-mt-6"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-white rounded-md shadow-lg"><div class="text-2xl">Step 6</div></span></div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Charge Subscriptions Fee</h3><div class="mt-5 text-base text-gray-500"> Once your community is grown. You can start charging for a subscription fee to become a member of your group. </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pt-10 bg-white sm:pt-16 lg:pt-8 lg:pb-14 lg:overflow-hidden"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl lg:px-8"><div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-md px-4 sm:max-w-2xl sm:px-6 sm:text-center lg:px-0 lg:text-left lg:flex lg:items-center"><div class="lg:py-16"><a target="_blank" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/odd-cirlces/id6443508748" class="inline-flex items-center text-white bg-black rounded-full p-1 pr-2 sm:text-base lg:text-sm xl:text-base hover:text-gray-200"><span class="px-3 py-0.5 text-white text-xs font-semibold leading-5 uppercase tracking-wide bg-blue rounded-full">Download on App Store</span><svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5 text-gray-500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.293 14.707a1 1 0 010-1.414L10.586 10 7.293 6.707a1 1 0 011.414-1.414l4 4a1 1 0 010 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl tracking-tight font-extrabold text-grey-900 sm:mt-5 sm:text-6xl lg:mt-6 xl:text-6xl"><span class="block">Community: where every day is an event, and every event is an opportunity to foster stronger connections.</span></h1><a target="_blank" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/odd-cirlces/id6443508748" class="inline-flex mt-3 w-48 h-14 bg-black text-white rounded-lg items-center justify-center mr-3"><div class="mr-3"><svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" width="30"><path fill="currentColor" d="M318.7 268.7c-.2-36.7 16.4-64.4 50-84.8-18.8-26.9-47.2-41.7-84.7-44.6-35.5-2.8-74.3 20.7-88.5 20.7-15 0-49.4-19.7-76.4-19.7C63.3 141.2 4 184.8 4 273.5q0 39.3 14.4 81.2c12.8 36.7 59 126.7 107.2 125.2 25.2-.6 43-17.9 75.8-17.9 31.8 0 48.3 17.9 76.4 17.9 48.6-.7 90.4-82.5 102.6-119.3-65.2-30.7-61.7-90-61.7-91.9zm-56.6-164.2c27.3-32.4 24.8-61.9 24-72.5-24.1 1.4-52 16.4-67.9 34.9-17.5 19.8-27.8 44.3-25.6 71.9 26.1 2 49.9-11.4 69.5-34.3z"></path></svg></div><div><div class="text-xs">Download on the</div><div class="text-xl font-semibold font-sans -mt-1">App Store</div></div></a><div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12"></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 -mb-16 sm:-mb-48 lg:m-0 lg:relative"><div class="mx-auto max-w-md px-4 sm:max-w-2xl sm:px-6 lg:max-w-none lg:px-0"><img alt="meetup alternative" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto lg:absolute lg:inset-y-0 lg:left-0 lg:h-5/6 lg:w-auto lg:max-w-none play_video" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/images/meetup-alternative.png"/></div></div></div><div class="mt-24 sm:mt-6 bg-sky-300 my-6 p-12 sm:rounded-md"><h1 class="mt-0 mb-6 sm:mt-3 font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-6xl">Supercharge Your Group&#x27;s Growth: Get Weekly Growth Tips in Your Inbox!</h1><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-3"><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-4 h-full"><label class="text-gray-900 mt-6">Firstname</label><input type="text" required="" placeholder="jon" class="mb-6 border-2 w-full border-gray-300 px-6 py-3 bg-white rounded-md mr-3" name="name"/></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 h-full"><label class="text-gray-900 mt-6">Email</label><input type="email" required="" placeholder="john@doe.com" class="mb-6 border-2 w-full border-gray-300 px-6 py-3 bg-white rounded-md mr-3" name="email"/></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-2 h-full"><button class="my-6 border-2 cursor-pointer border-gray-300 px-6 py-3 w-full bg-white rounded-md">Subscribe</button></div></div><div class="mt-0 sm:mt-3 font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-xl">We will <span class="text-blue-900">never</span> share your information to anyone, it is safe with us!</div></div></div></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center"><a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/oddcircles.com" target="_blank"><img alt="Trustpilot" loading="lazy" width="400" height="90" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-96 h-full top-0 left-0 object-cover rounded-2xl mx-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/images/home/trustpilot.png"/></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-3 my-12 p-3 sm:p-0"><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-4 border-2 rounded-md p-6"><a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/oddcircles.com" target="_blank" class="review-card"><div class="border-b-2 pb-2 mb-2"><div class="font-bold">Dan Richardson</div><div class="flex flex-column"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="text-gray-400 w-6 h-6"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m9.69 18.933.003.001C9.89 19.02 10 19 10 19s.11.02.308-.066l.002-.001.006-.003.018-.008a5.741 5.741 0 0 0 .281-.14c.186-.096.446-.24.757-.433.62-.384 1.445-.966 2.274-1.765C15.302 14.988 17 12.493 17 9A7 7 0 1 0 3 9c0 3.492 1.698 5.988 3.355 7.584a13.731 13.731 0 0 0 2.273 1.765 11.842 11.842 0 0 0 .976.54